Quarry are beings that came to [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]] with the Dark Bramble. They have no body of their own in the world; they take one by writing themselves into a corpse, and the shape they wear is a borrowed one. They are tethered to [[People/Althane/The Crystalpoint Lattice|the Crystalpoint Lattice]], which they pilot.

They spent years trying to revive the Dark Bramble, reaching out to [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessians]] they believed still alive, and it was they who woke [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Nox|Nox]]. They were seen in the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Gulch]] sewing souls back together with cords, and in the bodies of the dead.
